WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.5 · Brand, Identity & Image
Visual identity

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A simple visual system used everywhere makes you recognisable, even before your logo is finished.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start with a clean wordmark, colours and typefaces.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check contrast and never rely on colour alone.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Show real people, with consent and dignity.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You define the first elements of your visual identity.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
